*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&  Include           ZMM_MASS_STOCK_INTAKE_SSC
*&  Selection screen definition
*&
*&  Blocks:
*&    b_file — File upload path
*&    b_post — Posting options (movement type, date, texts)
*&    b_test — Test mode flag
*&
*&  Text elements to maintain in SE38 (Goto -> Text Elements):
*&    TEXT-t01  = 'File Upload'
*&    TEXT-t02  = 'Posting Options'
*&    TEXT-t03  = 'Test / Simulation Mode'
*&    TEXT-rb1  = '561 / 562  -  Initial stock entry (no reference document)'
*&    TEXT-rb2  = '501 / 502  -  Goods receipt without Purchase Order'
*&    TEXT-p01  = 'Posting Date'
*&    TEXT-p02  = 'Header Text'
*&    TEXT-p03  = 'Reference'
*&    TEXT-p04  = 'Simulate only - do not post'
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* BLOCK 1 — FILE UPLOAD
* p_file: full local path to the CSV or XLSX file.
* The F4 button (AT SELECTION-SCREEN event below) opens a file dialog.
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK b_file WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-t01.
  PARAMETERS: p_file TYPE localfile OBLIGATORY.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK b_file.

SELECTION-SCREEN SKIP 1.

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* BLOCK 2 — POSTING OPTIONS
* rb_561 / rb_501: radio group — user picks which movement type pair.
* p_budat: accounting posting date (defaults to today).
* p_bktxt: free text written to the material document header.
* p_xblnr: optional external reference / note (e.g. 'Nedleggelse 1659').
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK b_post WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-t02.

  PARAMETERS: rb_561 RADIOBUTTON GROUP mvt DEFAULT 'X',   "561/562
              rb_501 RADIOBUTTON GROUP mvt.               "501/502

  SELECTION-SCREEN SKIP 1.

  PARAMETERS: p_budat TYPE budat  DEFAULT sy-datum OBLIGATORY.
  PARAMETERS: p_bktxt TYPE bktxt.
  PARAMETERS: p_xblnr TYPE xblnr1.

SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK b_post.

SELECTION-SCREEN SKIP 1.

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* BLOCK 3 — TEST / SIMULATION MODE
* Default is checked (active). When active, all validation runs
* and the ALV log is fully populated, but BAPI is NOT called.
* The ALV header shows a warning banner when simulation is on.
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK b_test WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-t03.
  PARAMETERS: p_test AS CHECKBOX DEFAULT 'X'.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK b_test.

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* F4 HELP — FILE BROWSER
* Opens a local file dialog when the user presses F4 on the file field.
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON VALUE-REQUEST FOR p_file.
  CALL FUNCTION 'KD_GET_FILENAME_ON_F4'
    EXPORTING
      static    = abap_true
      mask      = '*.csv;*.xlsx'
    CHANGING
      file_name = p_file.
